-          While you're signed in, you can use your passwords and more from your Google Account in Chromium. <ph name="SHORTCUT">$1<ex>CTRL+SHIFT+M</ex></ph> can change your Google services settings.
+          While you're signed in, you can use your passwords and more from your Google Account in Agentic Browser. <ph name="SHORTCUT">$1<ex>CTRL+SHIFT+M</ex></ph> can change your Google services settings.
         </message>
